Aim:
To write a program using Pandas to create a DataFrame, clean the data (remove duplicates, remove null values), standardize column names, and display basic DataFrame details.

Algprithm:
S1-Start
S2-Import pandas as pd.
S3-Create a dictionary data with columns such as Name, Age, and salary including some missing values.
S4-Create a DataFrame using pd.DataFrame(data).
S5-Remove duplicate rows using drop_duplicates().
S6-Remove rows with missing values using dropna().
S7-Convert all column names to lowercase using df.columns.str.lower().
S8-Display the first few rows using head().
S9-Display DataFrame information using info().
S10-Display statistical summary using describe().
S11-Stop
